    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vītĕus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		vitis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the vine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coliculus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 31, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pocula,</span>”
				i. e. <i>wine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 380</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rura,</span>”
				<i>planted with vines</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Ham. 228</span></i>
			.</div>
